    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG4_U04_L05_Q02</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG4.R.06</p><p>Which structure best supports developed argument writing?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
